[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1730066604","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/15007#issuecomment-1730066604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/15007","id":1730066604,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M5nHris","user":{"login":"rsuderman","id":5508949,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDg5NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5508949?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman","html_url":"https://github.com/rsuderman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsuderman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-21T18:09:09Z","updated_at":"2023-09-21T18:39:27Z","body":"Whats more interesting is that swapping triggers the numerical difference. The following two programs are identical minus ordering:\r\n\r\nBroken: https://gist.github.com/rsuderman/0a45f821bcba989a6731be4fc683a0fa\r\nWorking: https://gist.github.com/rsuderman/0a54de6520f355d6ca34615c4c66788b\r\n\r\nIt appears the continue breaking if const eval, constant hoisting, or inline dynamic execution are enabled.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1730066604/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"min